### teste cadastro de funcionario

POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "mario",
    "email":"mario@gmail",
    "senha": "abc"
}

### teste de login com funcionario
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"mario@gmail",
    "senha": "abc"
}

### teste de cadastro de motorista - rota privada

POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Eliel",
    "cnh": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678990",
    "telefone": "48999998888"
}

### Listar Todos os motorista (Privado)
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### Consultar motorista por ID (Privado)
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 10. Atualizar motorista 2(Privado)
PUT http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Marcos",
    "cnh": "789",
    "cpf": "98765432114",
    "telefone": "48999998888"
}

### 22. Deletar motorista
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/2
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

